step On the way: north Barrens
  zone map 1413
  tip Right on the road south from Ashenvale. · Climb the rig, and it's on the chair behind the goblin supervisor. · On your way south. · It's at the mouth of the cave, so you don't go into the dungeon. · On your way south to the Great Lift. · Click the remains to finish '…and that note you found'.
  task "Arcanic Systems Manual" optional
  task "Secrets of the Dreamers" optional
  task "Cozy Sleeping Bag · step 2" optional

step South Barrens, next to the Great Lift
  zone map 1413
  accept 6626 "A Host of Evil" @49.0,94.9

step A Host of Evil
  zone map 1413
  tip Kill 8 Razorfen Battleguard, 8 Razorfen Thornweavers, and 8 Death's Head Cultists and return to Myriam Moonsinger near the entrance to Razorfen Downs. · Mobs are 33-35 around the Razorfen Downs entrance, so pull one at a time. ~3,450 XP.
  complete 6626 "A Host of Evil" @48.9,95.6
  turnin 6626 "A Host of Evil" @49.0,94.9

