step Ratchet, then the boat
  zone map 1413
  tip Grab the flight path. · Stay off the Crossroads road, since it's Horde. · Neutral town, safe. · Grab the Booty Bay flight path (top floor).
  task "Ride to Ratchet" optional
  task "Baxtan: On Destructive Magics" optional
  accept 1180 "Goblin Sponsorship" @62.7,36.2
  task "Boat to Booty Bay" optional

step Goblin Sponsorship
  zone map 1413
  tip Speak with Wharfmaster Lozgil in Booty Bay. · Hand in: Wharfmaster Lozgil, Stranglethorn (26.4, 73.6). · Hand it in as soon as you step off the boat. ~710 XP.
  turnin 1180 "Goblin Sponsorship" npc 4631 "Wharfmaster Lozgil" map 1434 @26.3,73.6

